; ************************************************************************************************
; @file       style.reg
; @brief      Windows Registry file style and comment template
; @details    Template for consistent, professional .reg file documentation and sectioning.
;
; @author     Justin Reina, Firmware Engineer
; @created    <YYYY-MM-DD>
; @last rev   <YYYY-MM-DD>
;
; @notes      This template provides a standard for .reg file comments, sectioning, and metadata.
;
; @section    Opens
;     <open item 1>
;     <open item 2>
;
; @section    Guidelines
;     - Use ';' for all comments and section headers.
;     - Begin with a block header for file metadata and legal.
;     - Use [SECTION] for logical groupings and explanations.
;     - Place registry keys/values after relevant section comments.
;     - Keep line width ~100 chars for readability.
;     - Document purpose, operation, risks, todos, and references as needed.
;
; @section    Legal Disclaimer
;     © <Year> <Owner>. All rights reserved. All contents of this file are proprietary.
;     Do not distribute. Do not copy.
; ************************************************************************************************

Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; [SECTION] Purpose
;     <purpose statement>
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; [HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Example]
; "ExampleValue"=dword:00000001

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; [SECTION] Operation
;     <operational flow or sequencing>
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; [HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Example]
; "UserSetting"="Value"

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; [SECTION] Hazards and Risks
;     <risk 1>
;     <risk 2>
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; [SECTION] TODO
;     <todo item 1>
;     <todo item 2>
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

; [SECTION] Reference
;     <reference 1>
; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
